Step 1 had the model fetch, rebase both workspaces, and reindex by
copying shell from the skill. just get-up-to-date now does that work
deterministically, the same way the process-email loop does, so a
single pass and the loop start from the same state and the model
spends its effort only on what the rebase leaves to settle.
