+fresh change in the mail workspace, and indexes the list, so messages
+you already answered count as replied. `just process-email` runs it
+before each pass too; running it again is harmless. If it fails, a
+fetch or rebase could not run at all: say so in your reply and do not
+build on a stale tree.
 
